WEBVTT

NOTE sample

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
صَباح الخَيْر!
ṣabāḥ el-khēr!
Good morning!

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.000
عَايْزَة قَهْوَة مِن فَضْلَك.
ʿāyza ahwa min faḍlak.
I would like a coffee, please.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.500
بِسُكَّر وَلَّا مِن غَيْر سُكَّر؟
bi-sukkar wallā min ghēr sukkar?
With sugar or without sugar?

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
مِن غَيْر سُكَّر، شُكْرًا.
min ghēr sukkar, shukran.
Without sugar, thank you.
